---
import GlitchPortrait from './GlitchPortrait.astro';
---

<section id="about" class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1920px] px-6 py-24 md:px-10 lg:px-16" aria-labelledby="about-heading">
  <div class="w-full">
    <h2
      id="about-heading"
      class="font-display mb-12 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight md:text-4xl"
    >
      About me
    </h2>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-10 lg:grid-cols-3 lg:gap-12">
      <div class="space-y-6 text-base leading-relaxed text-text/90 md:text-lg">
        <p>
          I am an AI product designer with 26 years of experience, working in print, digital, and
          now AI. I merge all three skill sets to cope with the rapid pace 2026 has brought upon us.
        </p>
        <p>
          You get to work with one of the best designers in the business. You want to know my process and all that
          bollocks? Well, here it is: always start with the problem. Why are you delivering this
          work? What value does it bring to the business and the User. Ask questions, as we always
          have done. Speak to users, build relationships with the people building it, and you&apos;ll
          go far with your product. It&apos;s not magic or complicated. Communication is the key
          skill for successful product delivery.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-6 text-base leading-relaxed text-text/90 md:text-lg">
        <p>
          I&apos;ve done it all from running my own companies, to building startups for others 0
          to 1. Been a freelancer for 15 years working in studios and banks producing some great
          work and working with many wonderful people. I now work as an IC at J.P. Morgan, embedded
          as an internal consultant on product design for the senior leadership team working between
          design, AI and research.
        </p>
        <p>
          Today, I sit in the Claude Code forum at the bank as the only designer who has a license
          for it, running experiments daily to bring efficiencies to the design process through the
          use of AI and how AI can help us as designers.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex justify-center lg:justify-end">
        <GlitchPortrait />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
